     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi everyone, <u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I did a Phylogenetic MANOVA to assess differences in beak\r\nshape between the groups means of a categorical behavioural category. I got\r\nslightly counter-intuitive results (at least for me). I got a statistically\r\nsignificant correlation between shape and UBF categories (meaning that there\r\nare significant differences between groups) but no significant differences\r\nbetween groups in shape, is this possible? Am I missing something?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Script:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">beak_data &lt;- geomorph.data.frame(coords = beak_coords2,\r\ndiet2 = diet2, MA = ant.MA2, BM = log.BM2, UBF.C = UBF1, phy = birdTree)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">PGLS.coords_UBF &lt;- advanced.procD.lm(coords ~ UBF.C,\r\ncoords ~ 1, group= ~UBF.C, phy = beak_data$phy, data = beak_data, iter=999)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">summary(PGLS.coords_UBF)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">summary:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">ANOVA\r\nTable<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">           Df      RSS       \r\nSS     Rsq     F     \r\nZ Pr(&gt;F)   <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Y ~\r\n1     174 0.059486                                         <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Y ~\r\nUBF.C 169 0.051525 0.0079605 0.13382 5.222 4.2081 <b> 0.001 **</b><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">---<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Signif.\r\ncodes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05\r\n‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">P-values<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">                  Cracking/biting Filtering Grabbing/gleaning Pecking/grazing Probing Tearing<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Cracking/biting             1.000     0.661             0.512           0.522   0.520   0.610<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Filtering                   0.661     1.000             0.758           0.746   0.664   0.732<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Grabbing/gleaning           0.512     0.758             1.000           0.815   0.536   0.575<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Pecking/grazing             0.522     0.746             0.815           1.000   0.540   0.609<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Probing                     0.520     0.664             0.536           0.540   1.000   0.532<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Tearing                     0.610     0.732             0.575           0.609   0.532   1.000</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Also, before the RRPP\r\nimplementation with geomorph v.6.0.6 I obtained pairwise statistical\r\ndifferences among some of the groups, which I guess it means clade-group\r\naggregation was affecting my results (some of these categories are largely\r\nrestricted to some particular clades)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks in advance, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Guille<u></u><u></u></p></div>"
